to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-16 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-16 = cons "- **Apple and Ink & Switch.** Apple comes closest to personal computing (processing on the device," (cons "  structural privacy, devices aware of each other), but only within its walls: things work together" (cons "  when Apple wrote both sides, third-party apps stay sealed, and Apple stays the middle through the" (cons (quoted (cons "  App Store. It solves " (cons "your Apple" (cons ", not your computer. Ink & Switch holds the right premises" nil)))) (cons "  (local-first, malleable software, user-owned data, merging without a server) but builds on the" (cons "  stack it criticizes (JavaScript, JSON, the browser, files), so its shared data still has no types," (cons "  no identity beyond structure and no proofs. Hyperactivity starts where both stop: the kernel and" (cons "  the language." nil)))))))
